# The root Pages project uploads the whole repo (assets.directory ".").
# Agent-generated lab tenants must NOT appear on the apex origin: mino.mobi is
# inside Domain=.mino.mobi, which the shared SSO cookie and the auth worker
# wildcard origin allowlist both cover. See docs/LAB-FACTORY.md sections 2-3.
lab/

# The prompt corpus is personal data. The root Pages project uploads the whole
# repo, so this directory must stay unserved. preflight asserts this line is
# here — see the "prompt log stays unserved" check.
packages/homunculus/log/

# Session transcripts collected during a recovery pass live here on feature
# branches while the repo is temporarily private. Never served, and never
# merged to main — see scripts/assert-public-safe.mjs and the merge-candidate
# flow in CLAUDE.md.
homunculus/inbox/

# The whetstone lab's run archive: transcripts, scorecards and each run's commons. Read from
# GitHub raw by del.mino.mobi/runs/, never through this worker. The commons holds the miniphim's
# own pages (commons/www/), which run their JavaScript: served here they would be same-origin with
# mino.mobi. Their pages live on minomobi.com, away from the sign-in, and only there.
packages/whetstone/runs/
